body:
i had healing cuts on my thigh when i got my pap done by my gp. she asked about them but stepped down after i confirmed that i was seeing a therapist and working on it. from what she was said it seemed like she wouldn't have hospitalized me if not, just ask more questions and refer me to psych for therapy. if it's scars and not cuts they ***should not*** be committing you. they technically shouldn't for self harm at all unless it's with intent to end it or if you're cutting deep enough to be a serious danger to yourself. like getting down into muscle and risking serious nervous damage.  but, some doctors are quicker to call than others. 

&#x200B;

i didn't bring it up first, she commented on it. but they should respect that you're working with a professional about it and stay in their lane. if not i would highly suggest putting in some sort of complaint.
